    "premedReqRec": "Four semesters of chemistry with laboratory are required with the additional requirement that at least one semester is organic chemistry.  The remaining 3 semesters, for example, may be general chemistry and/or biochemistry.  One year of Physics with lab, one year of Biology or Zoology with lab, one year of English - courses in composition and literature are strongly recommended.  AP credits do not count towards prerequisites.",
